  "title": "Upside-Down Pumpkin Cake",
  "description": "This pumpkin upside-down cake has become my family's favorite dessert at Thanksgiving, taking the place of pumpkin pie! Walnuts can be substituted for pecans.",
  "authors": [
    "JCAIN2U"
  ],
